%% source: fictional example (music player app, playback states of one track)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Stopped

    Stopped --> Loading: Track Chosen
    Loading --> Buffering: Stream Opened
    Loading --> Unavailable: Track Removed

    Buffering --> Playing: Buffer Full
    Buffering --> Stalled: Network Slow
    Stalled --> Buffering: Network Back
    Stalled --> Offline: Network Gone

    Playing --> Paused: Pause Pressed
    Paused --> Playing: Play Pressed
    Paused --> Stopped: Idle 30 Minutes

    Playing --> Seeking: Scrubber Dragged
    Seeking --> Buffering: New Position Set

    Playing --> Ducked: Notification Sound
    Ducked --> Playing: Sound Finished

    Playing --> Crossfading: Ten Seconds Left
    Crossfading --> Loading: Next Track Queued
    Crossfading --> Ended: Queue Empty

    Ended --> Loading: Repeat On
    Ended --> Stopped: Player Closed

    Offline --> LocalCopy: Track Downloaded
    Offline --> Stopped: No Download
    LocalCopy --> Paused: Pause Pressed
    LocalCopy --> Buffering: Network Back

    Unavailable --> Loading: Skip to Next
    Unavailable --> Stopped: Nothing Queued

    Playing --> Handoff: Speaker Picked
    Handoff --> Casting: Speaker Ready
    Handoff --> Playing: Speaker Lost
    Casting --> Playing: Speaker Disconnected

    Stopped --> [*]: App Closed

    note right of Playing
        Audio coming out of the phone
        Position saved every few seconds
        Lyrics scroll along
    end note

    note right of Offline
        No connection at all
        Only downloaded tracks can play
        Queue keeps its order
    end note
